	            <h2 class="art-postheader"><a href="http://joomlamadesimple.com.ng/2013/01/30/hello-world/" rel="bookmark" title="Learn How To Develop A Database Driven Websites Without Any Knowledge of Programming!">Learn How To Develop A Database Driven Websites Without Any Knowledge of Programming!</a></h2>	                <div class="art-postcontent">
	                    <!-- article-content -->
	                    <p><span style="color: #333333;"><strong>DO YOU WANT TO BE ABLE TO DESIGN A DATABASE DRIVEN WEBSITES WITHOUT ANY PROGRAMMING KNOWLEDGE? NO WORRIES!</strong></span></p>
<p><b><br />
</b><b>JOOMLA MADE SIMPLE STEP BY STEP VIDEO TUTORIAL CD 1 &amp; 2 IS MADE FOR YOU.</b></p>
<p>In the age of ‘ONLINE’ here and there, having a web presence is more important than ever. In response, there are proliferation of web page design programs that promise good web pages with little or no web programming experience. Joomla does not necessarily play in this space, but how possible is it to construct web sites using Joomla with no programming experience?<br />
The answer is: <b>IT IS VERY POSSIBLE!</b></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>With our <b>HANDS – ON JOOMLA MADE SIMPLE CD 1 &amp; 2 VIDEO TUTORIAL</b>, you will be able to develop a database driven website in 4 hours without the knowledge of programming.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>In both CD 1 and 2, you will be able to develop a normal website and more advanced websites like the ones below: </b></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>Social Networking Site</p>
<p></b></p>
<p>A social Networking Service is an online service, platform, or site that focuses on facilitating the building of social networks or social relations among people who, for example, share interests, activities, backgrounds, or real-life connections.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>Internet Forum Site</p>
<p></b></p>
<p>An Internet forum, or message board, is an online discussion site where people can hold conversations in the form of posted messages.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>SMS Site</b></p>
<p>An SMS website is a site that has a telecommunications network facility for sending Short Message Service (SMS) to mobile phone networks.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>Dating Sites</b></p>
<p><b>Online dating</b> (<b>OD</b>) or <b>Internet dating</b> is a dating system which allows individuals, couples and groups to make contact and communicate with each other over the Internet, usually with the objective of developing a personal or romantic relationship.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>Live Support Software</b></p>
<p>Live support software (also called live chat, live help) is a popular term for online chat applications designed specifically to provide online assistance to users of a website.</p>
<p><b>Shopping Cart Software</b></p>
<p>In online marketing, a shopping cart is a piece of e-commerce software on a web server that allows visitors to an internet site to select items for eventual purchase.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>Download Link</b></p>
<p>A download can mean either any file that is offered for downloading or that has been downloaded, or the process of receiving such a file.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><b>All these and more, you can develop with our HANDS – ON JOOMLA MADE SIMPLE VIDEO TUTORIAL CD 1 &amp; 2 WITHOUT PROGRAMMING KNOWLEDGE</b></p>
<p><b>.</b></p>
<p><b>CD 1</b><b>: Contains how you can develop basic website with some features like Membership Login, Registrations, External links, Online Now, Scrolling Texts and lots more.</b></p>
<p><b>CD 2</b><b>: </b><b>Contains more advanced database driven application development like those mentioned above.</b></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
